# Generated web map data: published in the release data-latest (site-data.zip) and on
# GitHub Pages; the daily workflow commits only the README badge and meta.json, since
# the JSON is several MB a day even for the summary levels
site/data/*
!site/data/badge.json
!site/data/meta.json

